<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Zambia to privatise sole insurance broker.</title>
<headline>Zambia to privatise sole insurance broker.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Zambia Privatisation Agency said on Thursday it was inviting bids for the country's sole registered insurance broking firm, Zambia National Insurance Brokers Ltd.</p>
<p>The company has a workforce of 116. No financial details were disclosed in an advertisement in the South African press.</p>
<p>The closing date for bids is October 18.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
